### Constants

A number of constants are predefined:

| Name | Value | Value on Windows |
|---|---|---|
| `HEX`<sup>1.27.0</sup> | `"0123456789abcdef"` |  |
| `HEXLOWER`<sup>1.27.0</sup> | `"0123456789abcdef"` |  |
